<title>USA: NYS Dormitory Authority $30 mln revs repriced.</title>
<headline>NYS Dormitory Authority $30 mln revs repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Corp said it repriced a $30 million New York State Dormitory Authority revenue bond issue, adjusting yields on various maturities, including cutting the yield in 2026 to 5.66 percent from 5.71 percent.  </p>
<p>DORMITORY AUTHORITY OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $30,010,000*</p>
<p>BARNARD COLLEGE</p>
<p>INSURED REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>WE HAVE RECEIVED THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE THE PRICE CHANGE IN 2000, 2002-2007, 2016 AND 2026.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 12/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/1998		  575M    4.50  %	  4.00</p>
